{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23558","headline":"闻行简恩赐章服喜成长句寄之 · 白居易","name":"闻行简恩赐章服喜成长句寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾年五十加朝散，尔亦今年赐服章。\n齿发恰同知命岁，官衔俱是客曹郎。\n荣传锦帐花联萼，彩动绫袍鴈趂行。\n大抵着绯宜老大，莫嫌秋鬓数茎霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}